			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710740101,
					"content": "「老石」…唉，「老石」，我在层岩巨渊这么多年都没怎么见到过，辉山厅的那些大人们啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740102,
					"content": "哪天他们要是自己来做做这种找东西的事，就知道有多辛苦了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740103,
					"content": "沐宁——！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740104,
					"content": "哦，是你们啊，你们怎么还在层岩巨渊上层逗留…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740105,
					"content": "啊…当然，我没有不欢迎你们的意思！我的意思是…呃，你们没有别的要紧事去做吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740106,
					"content": "什么呀，我们只是看你在头疼所以才过来跟你打招呼的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740107,
						710740108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740107,
					"content": "发生什么了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710740109,
					"content": "唉…你知道「老石」吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740110,
					"content": "那是一种即使在矿区也很少出现的稀有矿物，在层岩巨渊这么多年我也只看过两三枚，那可真是常人想象不到的瑰丽宝石啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740111,
					"content": "据说品相最好的那种，看上去内含毫光，颜色犹如日暮之时海天之分那一线那般…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740112,
					"content": "你说的是这种？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710740113,
					"content": "…啊，这，你居然有，而且这是我见过的品相最完美的老石了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740114,
					"content": "#哎，我说{NICKNAME}啊，不如你把这枚「老石」卖给我吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740115,
						710740116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740115,
					"content": "绝无可能。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710740117,
					"content": "对，那可是一个朋友送给我们的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740118,
					"content": "而且，你哪来的钱够买「老石」呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740119,
					"content": "毕竟是公家的事，钱倒不是问题…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740120,
					"content": "公家的事？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740121,
					"content": "是啊，是辉山厅的大人们，最近不知道为何，突然对「老石」产生了兴趣，要求在层岩巨渊多找几枚给他们进行一些研究。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740122,
					"content": "可是我每天应付…咳咳，处理公务就已经够忙的了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740123,
					"content": "#不如这样吧，{NICKNAME}，如果你找到了「老石」，就带来给我，我把辉山厅的赏金给你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740124,
					"content": "不过品相不用像你手上那么好的，只要是「老石」就行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740125,
					"content": "辉山厅的赏金！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740126,
					"content": "按理说我应该亲自走一趟，但是层岩巨渊最近涉及到的事实在太多了，我有点分身乏术，只能拜托你们了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740127,
					"content": "唉，也不知道辉山厅的大人们要多少，不如就先拿三枚过来吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740128,
					"content": "好了好了，我们知道啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740116,
					"content": "想也别想。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710740108,
					"content": "有什么为难的事吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740109
					]
				}
			]
		},
