					"content": "是「举手之劳」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740805
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710740805,
					"content": "哇！我是说…嗯…这种东西和打倒巨兽一样，都是小意思而已！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740806,
					"content": "派蒙学会强词夺理了，可喜可贺。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740807
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710740807,
					"content": "哈哈…派蒙说的没错啦，两位力搏海魔的功绩，我们都看在眼里的。相信此等壮举对你们来说确实并不困难。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740808,
						710740809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740808,
					"content": "确实如此。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740810
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710740810,
					"content": "说来，没想到进了总务司，还要负责「在层岩找老石」这种工作…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740811,
					"content": "对哦，你那个时候不是还天天和自己父亲吵架。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740812,
					"content": "怎么后来去了总务司的呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740813,
					"content": "之前我不是欠了一大笔钱，走投无路，更不愿回家。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740814,
					"content": "结果讨债的人直接去盛露厅找上了我爸…我听到这件事时心想，我爸非得把我腿打断不可。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740815,
					"content": "可是你的腿看上去还挺完整的嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740816,
					"content": "是…说来惭愧，我爸帮我把钱还了，在街上找到了落魄的我，说，「你所有欠条都在我手里，所以现在你欠我钱了」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740817,
					"content": "以此要挟我找工作…以偿还欠款。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740818,
					"content": "原来你现在欠的是你爸的钱啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740819,
					"content": "是这样没错…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740820,
					"content": "当然，那个时候我每日逃债，惶惶不可终日，早就决定，如果有机会就一定洗心革面。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740821,
					"content": "但是我没想到这个机会竟然是那个时常跟我吵架的老爸给我的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740822,
					"content": "我爸也破天荒没有和我吵架，反而开诚布公地谈了谈，这种谈话要是能早些开始就好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740823,
					"content": "不过就算之前他有心跟我谈，那个时候我也没心情听吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740824,
					"content": "看来你家老爷子对你还蛮好的嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740825
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740825,
					"content": "是啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740826,
					"content": "所以无论如何，都得做好手上的工作。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740827,
					"content": "无论是这次层岩的事，还是帮辉山厅打杂找「老石」的活…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740828
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740828,
					"content": "这次活明明是我帮你做的吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740829
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710740829,
					"content": "找人帮忙完成工作，也是完成工作的一种方式。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740830
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740830,
					"content": "不过这次也真是多亏了二位，能这么快完成这件工作，出乎了我的意料。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740831
					],
					"speakerTitle": "沐宁"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740831,
					"content": "知道就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710740809,
					"content": "要说困难还是有一点啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710740810
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}